_{1}{e}^{{\\lambda }_{1}t}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]\\,\\text{and}\\,{c}_{2}{e}^{{\\lambda }_{2}t}[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nNow, notice that:\n\n- The tangents along the $x$-axis are pointing away from the origin, meaning that the solutions of the form \n${c}_{1}{e}^{{\\lambda }_{1}t}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]$\nmust approach infinity as $t\\to \\infty .$ So, we must have ${\\lambda }_{1}>0.$\n\n- The tangents along the $y$-axis are also pointing away from the origin, meaning that the solutions of the form \n${c}_{2}{e}^{{\\lambda }_{2}t}[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]$\nmust also approach infinity as $t\\to \\infty .$ So, we must have ${\\lambda }_{2}>0.$\n\nAmong the options, the only system that satisfies ${\\lambda }_{1}>0$ and ${\\lambda }_{2}>0$ is the following:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}^{′}(t)=3x(t) \\\\ {y}^{′}(t)=7y(t)\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535688 true] [17592186361288 1000 #edb/ref 17592186361289 13194139535688 true] [17592186361288 1000 #edb/ref 17592186361290 13194139535688 true] [17592186361288 1000 #edb/ref 17592186361291 13194139535688 true] [17592186361288 1000 #edb/ref 17592186361292 13194139535688 true] [17592186361288 1000 #edb/ref 17592186361293 13194139535688 true] [17592186361288 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535688 true] [17592186361288 1041 "selection" 13194139535688 true] [17592186361288 1104 #edb/ref 17592186361292 13194139535688 true] [17592186361288 1110 #uuid "c0466e64-28eb-5947-af1b-3f5bdfea0d6d" 13194139535688 true] [17592186361289 1034 "{\\begin{aligned}{x}^{′}(t)=-3x(t) \\\\ {y}^{′}(t)=7y(t)\\end{aligned}" 13194139535688 true] [17592186361289 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535688 true] [17592186361289 1111 #uuid "8087793b-ec9f-5620-9575-211579157e4a" 13194139535688 true] [17592186361290 1034 "{\\begin{aligned}{x}^{′}(t)=-7x(t) \\\\ {y}^{′}(t)=-3y(t)\\end{aligned}" 13194139535688 true] [17592186361290 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535688 true] [175